Owner request 2026-10-27: 'GOLD & ledger' read as jargon; the buttons now say 'Buy GOLD / history' and the panel 'GOLD · Buy & history' (zh: 購買 GOLD／查看紀錄, GOLD · 購買與紀錄); the Celestao and staking notes point to the same name. The top bar gets a visible Buy button next to the GOLD balance that opens the purchase panel (the 'GOLD ＋' label alone was not recognised as a button).

